; RT48 / PT48 (#679). Expectations from ADR 0052 and PT48, calculated independently.
; Handwritten ellissi.dxf: full/partial curves, both supported extrusions, XDATA.
; Z coordinates and extrusion groups must survive roundtrip without loss.
D = DXF file=ellissi.dxf
? version D -> AC1032
? units D -> 4
; PT48 deliberately changes these entities from raw to supported.
; cambia con #679
? count D -> ELLIPSE 4
? unhandled D -> none
? entity D 101 -> ELLIPSE center=10,20 major-axis=4,0 ratio=0.5
? entity D 102 -> ELLIPSE center=10,20 major-axis=4,0 ratio=0.5 start=30 end=120
? entity D 103 -> ELLIPSE center=-10,20 major-axis=-4,0 ratio=0.5 extrusion=0,0,-1
? entity D 104 -> ELLIPSE center=-10,20 major-axis=-4,0 ratio=0.5 start=270 end=0 extrusion=0,0,-1
? bbox D:101 -> 6,18 14,22
? bbox D:103 -> -14,18 -6,22
? snaps D:104 modes=endpoint -> Endpoint -10,22; Endpoint -14,20
? roundtrip D -> identical
? roundtrip D as=cadx -> identical
